text: |-
  Cover Up in
  Charlie Kirk
  The Classified Drone launching
  plane at Charlie Kirk's assassination
  just had a cover up. TWZ article
  documented the program. The
  article was removed, because it
  was proof of the N1098L flight to
  Charlie Kirk's event.
  Assassination
  Spy program of planes to drop off drones is Project
  HADES (High, Accuracy, Detection & Exploitation,
  System). Same plane model at assassination.
  https://www.twz.com/air/army-wants-to-test-air-launched-drones-from-a-global-express-business-jetFlight
  * TWZ
